    <string name="pad_height_hint">Width sets the button size. At 0 extra height the panel is a compact grid with equal gaps everywhere; more height only makes the touchpad taller.</string>
    <string name="set_cursor_hold">Long press at cursor: hold time</string>
    <string name="cursor_hold_hint">How long "Long press at cursor" holds. Drag lock also holds this long at the start point before moving. Up to 3 s.</string>
    <string name="drag_lock_hint">Drag lock: tap once to mark the start; a terracotta ring appears at the cursor and follows it. Move to the end point and tap again to drag; the ring shrinks there. Tap again without moving to cancel.</string>
    <string name="switch_show_panel">Show touchpad</string>
    <string name="switch_show_panel_hint">Off collapses it to the floating ball; tap the ball to expand again.</string>
